# An allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless named here. The repo
# root holds private firm data (io/), .env, run logs, and outputs that must
# never reach an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!cli/
!templates/
!scripts/health_check.py
!scripts/provision_firm.py
!scripts/docker-entrypoint.sh

# Even inside the allowed directories:
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
**/*.db
